/* DXMT / Direct3D 12 mismatch warning */
"This game uses Direct3D 12, which DXMT doesn't translate: the graphics still go through GPTK, with DXMT covering only part of the stack — a mix that can cause display problems. Switch to GPTK. If the game also offers a Direct3D 11 mode (Unreal titles take the launch option -d3d11), that avoids the split altogether and either backend will handle it." = "This game uses Direct3D 12, which DXMT doesn't translate: the graphics still go through GPTK, with DXMT covering only part of the stack — a mix that can cause display problems. Switch to GPTK. If the game also offers a Direct3D 11 mode (Unreal titles take the launch option -d3d11), that avoids the split altogether and either backend will handle it.";


